{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49075","headline":"菩萨蛮 二 · 昭宗皇帝","name":"菩萨蛮 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飘飘且在三峰下，秋风往往堪沾洒。\n肠断忆仙宫，朦胧烟雾中。\n思梦时时睡，不语长如醉。\n早晚是归期，苍穹知不知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"昭宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49075.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49075","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}